   "text": "the target, built after your look (the live Task page is MindMap · Status today):\nthe MindMap, then each step's results, read only: Plan, Build, Run, Read, Close; every section starts closed (▸), its state word on its right, a waiting line under one that waits on you; what it opens to is drawn under its bar, behind a dashed line;\neach view's 🙋 Interaction holds its own forms; the right rail ends Skills · Files, as live (261106); a form shows in the step its answer changes",
